WEBVTT

00:00:08.105 --> 00:00:15.465
On every workout: the name, a public part and a private part.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:18.680
Change the name and save. The page heading follows.

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:28.994
Public: your AI coach's insight and the figures, and below them your own text.

00:00:29.044 --> 00:00:33.606
Is the insight not right? Say what is wrong here. Only you see it; your AI coach writes the insight again. It does when you change your text, too.

00:00:33.656 --> 00:00:44.388
Private: what your AI coach tells only you, and your own notes. This never goes out.

00:00:44.438 --> 00:00:49.065
History: every version, with where it came from and when.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:52.666
Restore makes an old version the current one again. The other versions stay.

00:00:52.716 --> 00:00:57.571
Publish puts the insight and the figures in the Strava description. In Settings you choose whether new workouts start ticked.
